"``sensor.set_vsync_callback(callback)`` e alternar o ``Pin`` de dentro do "
"callback (\\ :ref:`a mudança do VSYNC <v3_9_4_vsync>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.4.rst:148
msgid ""
"Re-tune any MT9V034 gain/exposure workarounds against the corrected math "
